description = "Defines the rules governing all combat interactions — player vs creature, player vs player, and structure damage. Combat is simulation-driven: outcomes emerge from stats, skills, equipment, and biome conditions rather than authored scripts. Magic and martial paths are balanced by design — neither dominates at every range and context."
